# Microservice layout

Give each service its own `.slnx` for Rider. Include its Api, Application, Domain and Domain.Data projects and any contracts or test projects it owns. Resolve project paths relative to the solution file.

Use the SDK version agreed for the workspace in each applicable `global.json`. When it changes, align the pins in the affected repositories. From each solution directory, check `dotnet --version`, list its projects with `dotnet sln <service>.slnx list` and build that solution.

gRPC adapter → mediator → handler → EF/domain. No REST. No Hangfire. No `Infrastructure` — persistence is `Domain.Data`.

Domain must not reference EF, ASP.NET, or Application.
